se\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a>. It can be purchased via the front store and is located under the wooden roof on one of the brick pallets near the back right support beam.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Song\">Song</span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/68/Gurtydirty42.mp3/revision/latest?cb=20230718203953\" width=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 300px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gurtydirty42.mp3\">https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gurtydirty42.mp3</a></audio></span>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Vinyls_Nav\" title=\"Template:Vinyls Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Vinyls_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Vinyls_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=